sequenceDiagram
    User ->> Client (GUI): Initiates login request
    Client (GUI) ->> Authentication Component: Send username/password
    Authentication Component ->> User Database: Validate credentials
    User Database ->> Authentication Component: Return validation result
    Authentication Component ->> Session Manager: Create session
    Session Manager ->> User Presence Component: Update user status to online
    User Presence Component ->> Client (GUI): Display updated connected users
    Note right of Client (GUI): User is now logged in and visible to others